<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
==Description==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
The [[Image:PartDesign_PathPattern.svg|24px]] '''PartDesign PathPattern''' tool duplicates selected features or the active body along a path.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
==Usage==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
# Optionally [[PartDesign_Body#Active_status|activate]] the correct Body.
# Optionally select one or more features in the [[Tree_View|Tree View]] or the [[3D_View|3D View]].
# There are several ways to invoke the tool:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:PartDesign_PathPattern.svg|16px]] [[PartDesign_PathPattern|Path Pattern]]}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Part Design → Transformation Features → [[Image:PartDesign_PathPattern.svg|16px]] Path Pattern}} option from the menu.
# If there is no active Body, and there are two or more Bodies in the document, the {{MenuCommand|Active Body Required}} dialog will open and prompt you to activate one. If there is a single Body it will be activated automatically.
# The {{MenuCommand|Circular Pattern Parameters}} [[Task_Panel|task panel]] opens. See [[#Options|Options]] for more information.
# Press the {{Button|OK}} button to finish.
</div>

